    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01HCX37TKGMD1J8XPKXA3XPSF2\">You will learn</h2><p>Learn how to integrate with Thanx, a guest engagement platform for on-brand loyalty focused on access, exclusivity, and personalization.</p><div><p>Ensure you have a completed Thanx datashare agreement before installing this integration. For assistance, contact your Thanx representative.</p></div><h2 id=\"h_01HCX37TKG5GVDR0314DVG66ZY\">Integrate Thanx with Klaviyo</h2><p>To integrate with Thanx:</p><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eb09ce2a3ef889de1f66beddea05235ee\">In Klaviyo, select the <strong>Integrations</strong> tab.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ed513d7edd87ede311bba491b996fd413\">Click <strong>Explore apps</strong>.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e1ff18aa825fcea9e7253c6f9ff893727\">Search for <em>Thanx</em> and select the card.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e69d1105df2b509792b9a4494c2f3a77f\">Click <strong>Install</strong>.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e8729d2856c34a6e662392f35f7e2c333\">On the next page, enter your Thanx Merchant ID and click <strong>Connect</strong>.<br><img style=\"height: auto;\" src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/36941375955995\" width=\"578\" height=\"388\">\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e81a47a8ba25cafcf7439e8200a28b6ae\">Review the permissions and select <strong>Allow</strong>. You'll be redirected to Klaviyo. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eb595cb69e6caaa7a631fbc179c2615fd\">Check the box to sync Thanx email subscribers to a Klaviyo list, and then select a list from the dropdown.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e724611c97eabc76f87951f7d3e201a1e\">Check the box to sync Thanx SMS subscribers to Klaviyo, and select a list from the dropdown. We recommend keeping separate lists for email and SMS subscribers. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e3ce4745cc2df9ef1ca3061145ad4a5ae\">When you're done, click <strong>Save</strong>.<br><img style=\"height: auto;\" src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/36949720268571\" width=\"1288\" height=\"1026\">\n</li>\n</ol><p>You have now successfully integrated Thanx with Klaviyo.</p><h2 id=\"h_01KN540KQHFAYF5Y1DA8Z9XXM2\">Update your Thanx integration</h2><p>To update the integration in Klaviyo:</p><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e314e3c5f4a81d8778fc6d04e0ba8badd\">Log in to Klaviyo.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e6cc405c58d235f741fd5427d6eeb0131\">Select the Integrations tab.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e9af1b0ed12fd25bbb6d2ba34414deda1\">Select <strong>Thanx</strong>.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ed53b951d8f14ece3658d31530cf26b1e\">Click the <strong>Update</strong> button in the banner.<br><img style=\"height: auto;\" src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/49424451336219\" width=\"1713\" height=\"371\">\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e57adc98feacf9e16165fbd8a03d7d3f1\">Review the permissions in Klaviyo and click Allow.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e88d519549988a14f64a8dae92879a0aa\">Review the permissions and select <strong>Allow</strong>. You'll be redirected to Klaviyo. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ee5d4e4d1125b13cec4af2304e47ed6e6\">Check the box to sync Thanx email subscribers to a Klaviyo list, and then select a list from the dropdown.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e2077f8db7a4a0bb21e6e2cbbe0c74277\">Check the box to sync Thanx SMS subscribers to Klaviyo, and select a list from the dropdown. We recommend keeping separate lists for email and SMS subscribers. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e1d14410ebe97ab8ff337cc8cb65b9758\">When you're done, click <strong>Save.</strong>\n</li>\n</ol><p><img style=\"height: auto;\" src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/36949720268571\" width=\"1288\" height=\"1026\"></p><h2 id=\"h_01KN540XTAJZK6HZ41EZD5WYK2\">Understand your Thanx data</h2><p>Klaviyo syncs real time Thanx transaction data via the <em>Placed Order</em> and <em>Earned Reward </em>metrics.</p><p>To view your Thanx data:</p><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e262cc3a4c095c19a74644019c234c477\">In Klaviyo, click the <strong>Analytics</strong> dropdown in the left-hand navigation.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e54247e943fa3b88e3e1ed91639bd30ca\">Select <strong>Metrics</strong>. Here, you can view all the metrics in your account. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e1de48c86e87855e8a5481c69698becad\">To filter this view to see only Thanx metrics, use the filter selector next to the search bar and select <strong>Thanx</strong>.<br><img style=\"height: auto;\" src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/49424479272091\" width=\"3162\" height=\"1312\">\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e839f96582ca9617abbae4a3b1e26908f\">Click on a metricto view detailed metric info.<br><img style=\"height: auto;\" src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28717994779547\" width=\"611\" height=\"293\">\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e66e3f54904a644efa245cdc37b7c3a20\">To view your Thanx objects (note: requires the latest version of the integration): Navigate to Content &gt; Objects. Here, you can view all of the objects in your account. The objects with a Thanx icon represent all of the objects synced from your Thanx integration.</li>\n</ol><p>Learn more about <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/19457831690139\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">your Thanx data</a>.</p><h2 id=\"h_01HCX37TKG4ZFVAZEXMK0VN4HP\">Use Thanx data in segments</h2><p>You can create segments in Klaviyo that include data from across metrics (<em>Placed Order, Earned Reward)</em> and objects (<em>Reward)</em>. </p><p>For example, using objects, you can create a segment of guests who have a reward that expires in the next 7 days:</p><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ef3897e18da2bc25abed83753ce90266c\">Navigate to <strong>Audience &gt; Lists &amp; segments.</strong>\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e16c7837bf6e9bafdc3c22c9419515650\">Click <strong>Create New</strong> and choose <strong>Create new segment</strong>.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ea1b7e53f9815f6a0d1a560c4b1e8f86d\">Name your segment and select tags if desired.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ecb15d18e5dad42cb5ae29272ace6944d\">Select the following definition and filter:<ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ec73d74f7acb844b3b00f30023847b40a\">Properties about someone &gt; Reward (Thanx) &gt; has</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e7c1fbe95ad785c53cdba1e190474d096\">where &gt; CampaignRedeemableTo &gt; in the next &gt; 7 days</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e264c6eda5c6a8698dfe58edba9f20339\">Click <strong>Create segment</strong>.</li>\n</ol><p><img style=\"height: auto;\" src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/49424451338267\" width=\"2942\" height=\"804\"></p><h2 id=\"h_01KN54BGAXDM9HD6ZZB5YZ9E8E\">Use Thanx data in flows</h2><p>You can use Thanx metrics and objects to trigger flows, or sequences of automated actions. Klaviyo offers multiple pre-built flows using Thanx data. To view these pre-built flows:</p><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ee013e93a5724b596663b60e58de925b5\">In Klaviyo, select the Flows tab.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e998da5d7d0888ee9f7863ca1355166ec\">Click Create flow.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e52560e638b9d28e6f9292f0e85274268\">\n<p>Filter by <em>Thanx</em> to see all Thanx flows.</p>\n<p><img style=\"height: auto;\" src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/49424451339291\" width=\"2022\" height=\"158\"><br> </p>\n</li>\n</ol><p>You can also create your own flows from scratch. For example, you can send messages to someone immediately when they sign up for your loyalty program.</p><p>To create the flow:</p><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e7c64cfbcb601604d41550fad32f1b1bf\">Click the <strong>Flows</strong> tab from the left-hand navigation.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ec40346740e3a43c7338590d8f84e73c6\">Click <strong>Create flow</strong> in the top right.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ec9e4f3cb476689d766184158d6d3196e\">Click <strong>Build your own</strong> in the top right.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e80c9967e5b9899c7644610c99f63cf71\">Name your flow and select tags if desired.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ece56d94f0ea6c9439cda220d6c9862d9\">Click <strong>Create Flow</strong>.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eb15b78558d0005d1d9476f658a53bf6a\">In the flow builder, choose <strong>Metric</strong> as the trigger.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e2d70b87feb0b6ceace3e3924875719c0\">From the dropdown, select <strong>Placed Order </strong>(with the Thanx icon).<br><img style=\"height: auto;\" src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28718022542875\" width=\"311\" height=\"203\">\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e45730a36dc999a70fb81eab52ec6e894\">Click <strong>Save</strong>.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ea56b92d383c70ed98296046f09b364e0\">Add time delays and email messages relevant to the triggering action.<br><img style=\"height: auto;\" src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28718022549531\" width=\"302\" height=\"550\">\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e7f18046384658b6d9e0b4a742f735bcb\">Once your content is ready, click <strong>Update Action Statuses</strong><strong> </strong>in the top right of the flow builder to set the flow live.</li>\n</ol><p>You can also use your Thanx <em>Reward</em> object to trigger Flows. For example you can send a message to someone 3 days before their Reward is scheduled to expire.</p><p>To create the flow:</p><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e6fa3a3cf118f65073566aad39aefd2e3\">Click the <strong>Flows</strong> tab from the left-hand navigation.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e320ecdfd71588bdcdd2a9218a4cb5e43\">Click <strong>Create flow</strong> in the top right.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eae3906dea17115e956851f772e7bb144\">Click <strong>Build your own</strong> in the top right.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e899247471c188b8682aad211d1a1acf7\">Name your flow and select tags if desired.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e08501fb36f2ba9b9addcb6ec06e39b8f\">Click <strong>Create Flow</strong>.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ee245b91263cb21fd4814d236f68cb9b5\">In the flow builder, navigate to <strong>All triggers &gt; Date property.</strong>\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ee49e17e743c8402b55cf31a74c8ba378\">From the dropdown, select <strong>Reward: CampaignRedeemableTo</strong><strong> </strong>from your Thanx integration.<br><img style=\"height: auto;\" src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/49424451340955\" width=\"2048\" height=\"994\">\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e33a22964571d794a78201d32599b5842\">Set the amount of time before the expiration date you want to send your message (e.g. 3 days) and the time of day you would like to deliver the message. Click <strong>Next. </strong>\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e33853febfa0e8b705b83eaa0d2e642ef\">Click <strong>Save</strong>.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e9805516c2f2d7b91e76cee6a1f219667\">Add time delays and email messages relevant to the triggering action.<br><img style=\"height: auto;\" src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/49424451343003\" width=\"2048\" height=\"993\">\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e72d2e73d5d3da5a78d7b25bd4d3aeb79\">Once your content is ready, click <strong>Review and turn on</strong><strong> </strong>in the top right of the flow builder to set the flow live.</li>\n</ol><h2 id=\"h_01HCX37TKHH9H6AA40ND5C2X7D\">Outcome</h2><p>You've now integrated Thanx with Klaviyo, learned about Thanx data in Klaviyo, and used Thanx data in flows.</p><h2 id=\"h_01HCX37TKHVPKGRTTZYGFJSZGD\">Additional resources</h2><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e51372ced4cad0525b9b3c3e685dc3d2a\">\n<a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/48577674406683\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to manage and distribute Thanx rewards via Klaviyo</a>.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ece513f2af0a4ae6cb1db457a8d62e295\">Take our course on <a href=\"https://academy.klaviyo.com/en-us/courses/enhance-restaurant-guest-relationships\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">enhancing restaurant guest relationships</a>.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ed5fbebbe0bd54fcf625325c290a39d26\">Learn more about <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115000256472\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Klaviyo-built integrations</a>.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e9ca94b9e4e0b7dbfba070fceb59a8cb6\">Learn <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005253208\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">how often integrations sync data</a>.</li>\n</ul>",
